#: includes/Mcp/Actions.php:22
msgid "Find Shortlink categories"
msgstr "Najdi kategorije kratkih povezav"

#: includes/Mcp/Actions.php:22
msgid "List native link categories with their current revision."
msgstr "Naštej domače kategorije povezav s trenutno revizijo."

#: includes/Mcp/Actions.php:23
msgid "Create or update a Shortlink category"
msgstr "Ustvari ali posodobi kategorijo kratkih povezav"

#: includes/Mcp/Actions.php:23
msgid ""
"Use native taxonomy controls and permissions. Read expected_hash from "
"list-categories before editing; omitted fields are preserved."
msgstr ""
"Uporabite domače nadzore in dovoljenja za taksonomijo. Preberite "
"expected_hash iz list-categories pred urejanjem; izpuščena polja so "
"ohranjena."

#: includes/Mcp/Actions.php:24
msgid "Set Shortlink categories"
msgstr "Nastavi kategorije kratkih povezav"

#: includes/Mcp/Actions.php:24
msgid ""
"Replace native category assignments with an explicit integer list. [] "
"clears assignments; use the current get-link revision."
msgstr ""
"Zamenjajte domače dodelitve kategorij z eksplicitnim seznamom celih števil. "
"[] izbriše dodelitve; uporabite trenutno revizijo get-link."

#: includes/Mcp/Actions.php:25
msgid "Set my Shortlink favorite"
msgstr "Nastavi moj priljubljeni Shortlink"

#: includes/Mcp/Actions.php:25
msgid ""
"Set favorite true or false for the connected user only. Read the current "
"get-link revision first."
msgstr ""
"Nastavi priljubljeno true ali false samo za povezanega uporabnika. Najprej "
"preberi trenutno get-link revizijo."

#: includes/Mcp/Actions.php:27
msgid "Update multiple Shortlinks"
msgstr "Posodobi več Shortlinkov"

#: includes/Mcp/Actions.php:27
msgid ""
"Preflight up to 20 existing links before any writes. Linked source targets "
"must not overlap. Each item uses the original get-link revision. Native "
"writes are not transactional: inspect complete, applied_ids and failed_id. "
"dry_run previews all items."
msgstr ""
"Preflight do 20 obstoječih povezav pred kakršnimi koli zapisi. Povezani "
"cilji virov se ne smejo prekrivati. Vsak element uporablja izvirno get-link "
"revizijo. Naravni zapisi niso transakcijski: preglej popolne, "
"uporabljene_id in neuspešne_id. dry_run predogleda vse elemente."

#: includes/Mcp/Actions.php:28
msgid "Delete a Shortlink category"
msgstr "Izbriši kategorijo Shortlink"

#: includes/Mcp/Actions.php:28
msgid ""
"Delete a native category without deleting its links. Authorize every "
"affected link and child category; read the current category revision first."
msgstr ""
"Izbriši naravno kategorijo, ne da bi izbrisal njene povezave. Avtoriziraj "
"vsako prizadeto povezavo in otroško kategorijo; najprej preberi trenutno "
"revizijo kategorije."

#: includes/Mcp/Actions.php:29
msgid "Read Shortlink click counts"
msgstr "Preberi število klikov na Shortlink"

#: includes/Mcp/Actions.php:29
msgid ""
"Read native daily chart counts and reset revision for one readable link. "
"Visitor IPs, user identifiers, referrers and raw request logs are excluded."
msgstr ""
"Preberi naravne dnevne števce grafik in ponastavi revizijo za eno berljivo "
"povezavo. IP-ji obiskovalcev, identifikatorji uporabnikov, napotitelji in "
"surove beleženje zahtevkov so izključeni."

#: includes/Mcp/Actions.php:30
msgid "Reset Shortlink chart counts"
msgstr "Ponastavi števce grafik Shortlink"

#: includes/Mcp/Actions.php:30
msgid ""
"Mark this link analytics cleared through the native reset service. Audit "
"logs remain. Requires current analytics expected_hash, analytics and object "
"edit permissions. dry_run previews."
msgstr ""
"Označi to analitiko povezave, ki je bila izbrisana prek naravne "
"ponastavitvene storitve. Revizijski dnevniki ostanejo. Zahteva trenutno "
"analitiko expected_hash, analitiko in dovoljenja za urejanje objektov. "
"dry_run predogleda."

#: includes/Mcp/Actions.php:32
msgid "Read saved Shortlink health"
msgstr "Preberi shranjeno zdravje Shortlink"

#: includes/Mcp/Actions.php:32
msgid ""
"Read the native Pro health status and response code for one readable link. "
"Does not perform HTTP requests."
msgstr ""
"Preberi naravni Pro status zdravja in kodo odgovora za eno berljivo "
"povezavo. Ne izvaja HTTP zahtevkov."

#: includes/Mcp/Actions.php:33
msgid "Check Shortlink health"
msgstr "Preveri zdravje Shortlink"

#: includes/Mcp/Actions.php:33
msgid ""
"Run the active native Pro link checker for an editable link and store its "
"result. Native URL safety and type settings apply. Requires current "
"get-link expected_hash. dry_run does not request destinations."
msgstr ""
"Zaženi aktivni naravni Pro preverjevalnik povezav za urejeno povezavo in "
"shrani njegov rezultat. Veljajo nastavitve varnosti in tipa naravnega "
"URL-ja. Zahteva trenutno get-link expected_hash. dry_run ne zahteva "
"destinacij."

#: includes/Mcp/Actions.php:35
msgid "Read a post Shortlink"
msgstr "Preberi post Shortlink"

#: includes/Mcp/Actions.php:35
msgid ""
"Read the native editor Short String for an enabled post type without "
"generating a URL or changing metadata."
msgstr ""
"Preberi naravni urejevalnik Short String za omogočeno vrsto objave brez "
"generiranja URL-ja ali spreminjanja metapodatkov."

#: includes/Mcp/Actions.php:36
msgid "Set a post Short String"
msgstr "Nastavi post Short String"

#: includes/Mcp/Actions.php:36
msgid ""
"Update an enabled post native Short String, preserving other metabox "
"values. All auto-listed mirror links need permission and are included in "
"the revision. dry_run previews."
msgstr ""
"Posodobi omogočen naravni post Short String, pri čemer ohrani druge "
"vrednosti metaboxa. Vse avtomatsko naštevanje ogledalnih povezav potrebuje "
"dovoljenje in so vključene v revizijo. dry_run predogleda."

#: includes/Mcp/Actions.php:37
msgid "Set Shortlink publication status"
msgstr "Nastavi status objave Shortlink"

#: includes/Mcp/Actions.php:37
msgid ""
"Change a native link to publish, draft, pending or private with the current "
"revision and native publication permissions. Source-linked records retain "
"their native source lifecycle."
msgstr ""
"Spremeni naravno povezavo v objavljeno, osnutek, čakajoče ali zasebno s "
"trenutno revizijo in naravnimi dovoljenji za objavo. Zapiski, povezani z "
"virom, ohranjajo svoj naravni življenjski cikel virov."

#: includes/Mcp/Actions.php:38
msgid "Duplicate a Shortlink to a draft"
msgstr "Dupliciraj Shortlink v osnutek"

#: includes/Mcp/Actions.php:38
msgid ""
"Use the native Duplicate service with a new Short String and the connected "
"user as author. Requires source edit/read, category assignment and create "
"permissions. No password values are returned. dry_run previews without "
"creating a draft."
msgstr ""
"Uporabi naravno storitev Duplicate z novim Short Stringom in povezanega "
"uporabnika kot avtorja. Zahteva dovoljenja za urejanje/branje virov, "
"dodelitev kategorij in ustvarjanje. Nobeni vrednosti gesel se ne vrnejo. "
"dry_run predogleda brez ustvarjanja osnutka."

#: includes/Mcp/Actions.php:40
msgid "Clear the native autolink cache"
msgstr "Izbriši predpomnilnik naravnega avtoklinka"

#: includes/Mcp/Actions.php:40
msgid ""
"Invalidate native Pro autolink rules without changing links or settings. "
"Requires native manage_options and Shortlinks settings permission. dry_run "
"previews."
msgstr ""
"Neveljavne naravne Pro avtoklink pravilniki brez spreminjanja povezav ali "
"nastavitev. Zahteva dovoljenje za upravljanje možnosti in nastavitve "
"Shortlinkov. dry_run predogleda."

#: includes/Mcp/Actions.php:46
msgid "Read a Shortlinks report summary"
msgstr "Preberi povzetek poročila Shortlinks"

#: includes/Mcp/Actions.php:46
msgid ""
"Read native Pro totals, distinct visitor counts and averages for up to 20 "
"explicit readable links between start_date and end_date (YYYY-MM-DD). No "
"IPs, account IDs, referrers or request URLs are returned. Native report "
"totals include retained logs after chart resets."
msgstr ""
"Preberi naravne Pro skupne seštevke, število različnih obiskovalcev in "
"povprečja za do 20 eksplicitnih berljivih povezav med start_date in "
"end_date (YYYY-MM-DD). Nobeni IP-ji, ID-ji računov, napotitelji ali URL-ji "
"zahtevkov se ne vrnejo. Naravni poročni skupni seštevki vključujejo "
"obdržane dnevnike po ponastavitvah grafik."

#: includes/Mcp/Actions.php:50
msgid "Read Shortlinks settings"
msgstr "Preberi nastavitve Shortlinks"

#: includes/Mcp/Actions.php:50
msgid ""
"Discover exact native settings, choices and defaults. Passwords, license "
"data and unsupported native controls are excluded. Booleans are JSON "
"booleans, IDs integers, selections strings and lists arrays."
msgstr ""
"Odkrij natančne naravne nastavitve, izbire in privzete vrednosti. Gesla, "
"podatki o licencah in nepodprte naravne kontrole so izključeni. Booleani so "
"JSON booleani, ID-ji so celi števili, izbire so nizi in seznami so tabele."

#: includes/Mcp/Actions.php:51
msgid "Update Shortlinks settings"
msgstr "Posodobi nastavitve Shortlinks"

#: includes/Mcp/Actions.php:51
msgid ""
"Patch discovered fields using their exact schemas and current "
"expected_hash. Omitted settings and secrets remain unchanged. dry_run "
"previews native sanitized values."
msgstr ""
"Popravi odkrite podatke z uporabo njihovih natančnih shem in trenutnega "
"expected_hash. Izpuščene nastavitve in skrivnosti ostanejo nespremenjene. "
"dry_run predogleda naravne sanirane vrednosti."

#: includes/Mcp/Actions.php:52
msgid "Find Shortlinks"
msgstr "Najdi Shortlinks"

#: includes/Mcp/Actions.php:52
msgid ""
"List readable Shortlinks by title or status. Returns IDs and labels only; "
"use get-link to inspect configuration."
msgstr ""
"Naštej berljive Shortlinke po naslovu ali statusu. Vrača samo ID-je in "
"oznake; uporabi get-link za pregled konfiguracije."

#: includes/Mcp/Actions.php:53
msgid "Read a Shortlink"
msgstr "Preberi Shortlink"

#: includes/Mcp/Actions.php:53
msgid ""
"Read native per-link fields and current expected_hash; omit id to discover "
"defaults. No link passwords, raw visitor IPs or user-agent logs are "
"returned."
msgstr ""
"Preberi naravne per-link podatke in trenutni expected_hash; izpusti id za "
"odkrivanje privzetih vrednosti. Nobena gesla povezav, surovi IP-ji "
"obiskovalcev ali dnevniki uporabniškega agenta se ne vrnejo."

#: includes/Mcp/Actions.php:54
msgid "Create or update a Shortlink"
msgstr "Ustvari ali posodobi Shortlink"

#: includes/Mcp/Actions.php:54
msgid ""
"Create a published Shortlink with target_url and label, or patch id with "
"current expected_hash. Native redirect, expiration, autolink and active Pro "
"controls use discovered fields. All related source posts must be editable. "
"dry_run previews. No destination URLs are fetched."
msgstr ""
"Ustvari objavljen Shortlink z target_url in oznako ali popravi id s "
"trenutnim expected_hash. Naravna preusmeritev, potek, avtoklink in aktivne "
